<header class="entry-header"><div><h1 class="entry-title greek greek-term tooltip-trigger" tabindex="0" data-tooltip-type="greek" data-tooltip-label="ἀμφιάζω" data-meanings="vestir; revestir">ἀμφιάζω</h1><div class="entry-meta"><span>verbo; variante textual</span><span class="separator">·</span><span>THAYER G294 · variante ἀμφιάζω</span></div></div><div class="source-tag">THAYER</div></header>
